{"id":"4426338","name":"Bo Nix","team":"DEN","pos":"QB","grp":"QB","num":"10","head":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/headshots/nfl/players/full/4426338.png","age":26,"exp":"3","college":"Oregon; Auburn","draft":["2024","1","12"],"depth":{"pos":"QB","rank":1,"unit":"3WR 1TE","team":"DEN"},"inj":{"status":"Active","note":"Nix continued his season-long trend of sticking to mostly short-area passes, leading to a season-low passing yardage figure and average of 4.0 yards per attempt. The third-year signal-caller did reverse a trend of three straight games with sub-60.0 percent completion rates, but Nix also failed to throw a touchdown for the first time all season. Denver's defense did most of the heavy lifting, and both of the Broncos' touchdowns came on the ground,  while Nix now has three sub-200-yard passing efforts in the last four contests. The Oregon product should have a good chance of boosting his numbers in Week 7, however, as the Broncos visit the defensively challenged Cardinals on Sunday, Oct. 25.","date":"2026-10-16T04:54Z","detail":""},"next":{"opp":"KC","home":true,"date":"2026-11-01T21:25Z"},"dvp":{"r":3,"td":0.8,"yds":242.8,"n":32,"g":5},"news":[{"h":"What's wrong with Bo Nix? Exploring the Broncos QB's struggles, long-term status","d":"The Broncos are winning, but Nix is dealing with the roughest stretch of his career. Why is he struggling -- and is he still Denver's long-term QB?","t":"2026-10-23T10:00:00Z"},{"h":"The Broncos' defense has carried the team. Now QB Bo Nix wants to shoulder the load vs. Cardinals","d":"\u2014 Denver's ball-hawking defense has made it one of the better NFL teams so far this season.","t":"2026-10-22T21:31:21Z"},{"h":"Sean Payton: Broncos not considering benching Bo Nix amid offense's struggles","d":"The Broncos are not considering benching quarterback Bo Nix as the team struggles on offense, coach Sean Payton said Monday.","t":"2026-10-19T18:22:21Z"},{"h":"Defense bails out Broncos in overtime win as Bo Nix, offense struggle","d"